<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Kymmene control of Finnpap.</title>
<headline>EU clears Kymmene control of Finnpap.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Tuesday it had cleared the acquisition of full control of Finnish paper giant UPN-Kymmene of Finnpap Ltd from Metsae-Serla and Myllyloski.</p>
<p>The Commission said in a statement the operation would not add to Kymene's market share. Finnpap will handle the marketing and sale of Kymmene's products.</p>
</text>
